About the job
ABOUT THE JOB

Develop and maintain scalable, reusable, and high-performance applications using ReactJS and React Native.
Design and implement scalable Front-end Architecture for web and cross-platform mobile applications.
Collaborate with Product Owners, Designers, Backend Engineers, and QA teams to deliver end-to-end features.
Optimize application performance, responsiveness, and cross-platform compatibility across iOS, Android, and web.
Implement and manage application state effectively using modern State Management solutions such as Redux, Context API, Zustand, or similar.
