ABOUT YOU

Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Information Technology, Business Information Systems, or related fields.
From 5+ years of experience in Frontend Development with strong hands-on experience in ReactJS and React Native.
Solid understanding of JavaScript (ES6+), TypeScript, HTML5, and CSS3.
Strong knowledge of React ecosystem including Hooks, Context API, component lifecycle, and advanced State Management patterns.
Proven experience designing scalable Front-end Architecture for enterprise-level applications.
Strong understanding of Performance Optimization techniques for mobile and web applications.
Experience developing and maintaining Cross-platform Mobile Applications using React Native.
Experience working with RESTful APIs, asynchronous data handling, and mobile application lifecycle.
Familiarity with modern frontend tools and ecosystems (Webpack, Vite, npm/yarn, Git).
Understanding of Agile/Scrum development methodologies.


